# SSR-safe HTML sanitization

Never add `isomorphic-dompurify`, `jsdom`, or server-side `dompurify` imports. They pull ESM-only deps (`@exodus/bytes`) that crash Next.js on Vercel with `ERR_REQUIRE_ESM` 500s.

Use `@/lib/rich-text` (`sanitize-html`) for all HTML sanitize / plain-text conversion.

`pnpm prebuild` runs `scripts/check-banned-deps.mjs` and fails the build if those packages return.
